[00:19.20]Midnight rolls in over the harbor
[00:21.60]Headlights spill like paint on the tide
[00:24.00]The radio hums a song with no name
[00:26.40]I keep the window down for the ride
[00:28.70]
[00:38.40]Neon harbor, hold this moment
[00:40.80]Every signal pulling me home
[00:43.20]Neon harbor, burn a little brighter
[00:46.80]I was never out here alone
[00:48.41]
